ockquote><p><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>BlackFire</strong></cite><p>+rep   <span class=\"missing-media\">[wordword*]</span> 55<br></p></blockquote><p><br>Die Zahl die der Generator gegeben hat ist genau in der Mitte eurer, herzlichen Glückwunsch schonmal!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>-------</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Da derzeit der Shop einen Lieferengpass hat bitte ich euch zwei hier im Thread zu schreiben wieso gerade IHR die 50€ Steam Guthaben verdient habt! Die bessere Begründung wird die 50€ bekommen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Der Guthaben-Code wird sicherlich bald nachgeliefert!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>(Kann nur CHF kaufen im Laden da ich in der Schweiz lebe, deswegen muss ich auf den Shop warten)<span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59983,"threadID":4089,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1484842330,"lastEditTime":1484843263,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2237,"editor":"Gaara","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>#RIGGED  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Glückwunsch <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>und den anderen *hust* *hust*</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59984,"threadID":4089,"userID":2431,"username":"mronbekend","subject":"","time":1484842597,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>congrats  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">👍</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":59986,"threadID":4089,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1484842859,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>gw an beide <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span> mal gucken wer gewinnen wird <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</sp